```
Reason:
The fix changes the error handling for the case when the DSI host is not found. Instead of returning `-ENODEV`, it now returns `-EPROBE_DEFER`, which indicates that the probing should be deferred until the DSI host is available. This allows the system to retry the probing process later, ensuring proper initialization of the DSI bridge when its dependencies are ready.

